<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Hello, <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[client]</span></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Thank you for connecting with me for assistance in recovering a user name and/or password in Insperity Premier.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>You can share the below information with your employee to assist them in this process.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Please let me know if you have additional questions.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[signature]</span></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style=""><br><b style=""><font color="#3366ff">How to recover your Username or Password for Insperity's Employee Service Center</font></b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Below are the steps to recover your Username or Password for Insperity PremierTM</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>There are two links on the login page, one for <b>Username</b> and one for <b>Password?</b>&nbsp;<br><br></font><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>If you choose <b>Username</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ol><li><font face="arial">Enter your email&nbsp;</font><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></li><li><font face="arial">Choose how you would like to confirm your identity. You can either choose to answer your Security Questions or to have the system <br>email you a verification code for you to enter.&nbsp;<br><br><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="">&nbsp;</font></li><li><font face="arial">Once you enter the answer to your security questions or the verification code, the system will display your username<br></font><br><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></li><li><font face="arial">Select <b>Log In</b>&nbsp;<br><br><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></font></li><li><font face="arial">You will be routed to the login screen to enter your username and new password</font></li></ol></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">If you choose <b>Password</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ol><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Enter your <b>username and email.<br></b><br><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Choose how you would like to confirm your identity. You can either choose to answer your Security Questions or to have the system email you a verification code for you to enter.&nbsp;<br><br><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></span></li><li><font face="arial">Enter your new password<br><br><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></font></li><li><font face="arial">You will be routed to the login screen to enter your username and new password</font></li></ol></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Please call the Insperity Contact Center with additional questions at 866-715-3552.</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>